# `pnpm dev`.
#
# The API is a separate deployable from `backend.md` B1 onwards; run it beside
# the app with `pnpm dev:api` (workspace root). Without it every ask, example
# and recall call fails — which is the honest local shape of a two-origin
# deployment, and is why the port is written down here rather than guessed.
VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8787
